            <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-md" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="color: #25D366;" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86s.274.072.376-.043c.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.045.072.045.419-.1.824zm-3.423-14.416c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 2.112.551 4.095 1.517 5.823l-1.517 5.605 5.748-1.507c1.685.918 3.607 1.442 5.652 1.442 6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
            <span>Chat Admin <%= typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.brandName ? settings.brandName : 'Dents Web' %></span>
        </div>
        <button class="wa-chat-close" id="wa-close-btn" aria-label="Tutup Chat WhatsApp">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-chat-body">
        <p class="wa-chat-greeting">
            Ada yang bisa kami bantu seputar kebutuhan website, aplikasi, atau konsultasi digital Anda?
        </p>
        <textarea class="wa-chat-input" id="wa-message-input" rows="3" placeholder="Ketik pesan konsultasi singkat..."></textarea>
        <button class="wa-chat-submit" id="wa-send-btn" type="button">
